      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is Lan (CHAR_01), matching <Picture 2>: The same petite adult Vietnamese woman, slender body, fair rosy skin, warm brown eyes, dark brown half-up hair with a pale pink bow, pearl earrings, opaque white traditional ao dai over white trousers. Match her face exactly to the attached sheet..\n<Picture 1> is the complete 2 by 2 storyboard, not a start-frame collage. Read left to right, then row by row. Repeated appearances across panels are the same characters, not extra people.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] Lan sits in a ripe golden rice field at sunset, looks up at fluffy clouds, discovers a heart-shaped cloud and smiles tenderly.\n\nretention_analysis:\nPreserve each character identity and design from its assigned sheet. Use storyboard panels for composition and action order, not a multi-panel output.\n\ndetailed_description:\nStylized 3D animated film, large expressive eyes, softly shaded skin, finely detailed hair, delicate jewelry, soft cinematic lighting. Preserve the reference character design and facial proportions; do not turn characters into live-action humans.\n[Shot 1] storyboard panel row 1, column 1, labeled SHOT 1. Wide view of Lan seated on a grassy earthen bund among ripe golden rice, low sunset light from screen left. Hands on lap, gaze gently upward toward screen right. Light breeze through rice, fine hair strands and ao dai panels. Slow gentle push-in. Planned duration 4 seconds.\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.000, cut to storyboard panel row 1, column 2, labeled SHOT 2. Medium close-up in the same rice field. Lan subtly raises her chin and follows the clouds, showing quiet curiosity. Keep her face stable and movement small. Golden rim light, lavender-peach sky. Planned duration 3 seconds.\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.000, cut to storyboard panel row 2, column 1, labeled SHOT 3. Upward sky view matching the bottom-left storyboard panel. A clearly recognizable fluffy white heart-shaped cloud drifts among ordinary clouds. Natural vapor, peach-lit edges, no solid heart symbol. A slim distant golden field at bottom. No people in this shot. Planned duration 5 seconds.\n[Shot 4] At 00:12.000, cut to storyboard panel row 2, column 2, labeled SHOT 4. Close-up of Lan, white ao dai collar visible, same face and hairstyle. Looking upward screen right, a tender smile gradually forms. One natural blink. Steady camera, quiet romantic ending. Planned duration 3 seconds.\nRender sequential full-screen shots, never a grid or split-screen. Do not reproduce panel labels, borders, sheet layouts or white studio backgrounds. Preserve character count, facial identity, clothes and props. Clear natural-speed action; no unintended slow motion. No subtitles or watermarks.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nSoft breeze through ripe rice, gentle fabric rustle and faint distant birds. No dialogue, no narration and no music.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
        "[\"Storyboard, 2 rows by 2 columns: chronological shot order, staging, actions and setting.\", \"CHAR_01, Lan: The same petite adult Vietnamese woman, slender body, fair rosy skin, warm brown eyes, dark brown half-up hair with a pale pink bow, pearl earrings, opaque white traditional ao dai over white trousers. Match her face exactly to the attached sheet.. Identity reference only; not another story panel.\"]",
